</div>
<div class="inner_cell">
<div class="text_cell_render border-box-sizing rendered_html">
<p><strong>Introduction</strong></p>
<p>This project analyzes bike-share data from New York City, Chicago, and Washington, D.C. The goal is to answer three questions using the available data by importing, exploring, and visualizing the datasets with R. The analysis focuses on usage patterns, popular bike share stations, and user types to identify similarities and differences among the three cities.</p>

</div>
</div>
